"""현재 케이지 개선본33종과 구조물 포함 원본을 비교하는 정적 목록을 만든다."""
import html
import json
from pathlib import Path

REPO=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
rows=json.loads((REPO/'docs/cage-art-refresh.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))['facilities']
assert len(rows)==33
cards=[]
for code,row in sorted(rows.items()):
    original=row['originalReference'].removeprefix('web/')
    name=html.escape(row['name']);asset=html.escape(row['webpAsset']);png=html.escape(row['asset']);original=html.escape(original)
    cards.append(f'''<article data-search="{code} {name}" id="{code}">
<header><b>{code} · {name}</b><span>{len(row['cells'])}칸</span></header>
<button class="picture" data-asset="{asset}" data-original="{original}" data-title="{code} · {name}" aria-label="{name} 크게 보기"><img src="{asset}" alt="{code} {name} 개선본" loading="lazy"></button>
<p>{'승인한 미니 양호실 유지' if code=='C16' else '미니 양호실 스타일 · 원본 구조물 반영'}</p>
<footer><button class="compare">원본 + 구조물 보기</button><a href="{png}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">개선 PNG</a><button class="copy" data-code="{code}">번호 복사</button></footer></article>''')
page='''<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>케이지 이미지 목록 · 디지몬 챔피언십</title><link rel="icon" href="data:,"><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#102232;color:#eaf6ff;font-family:'Malgun Gothic',system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:28px 20px}h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 12px}main>p{color:#afc7d9;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 18px}a{color:#8ed8ff}nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}input{padding:12px;border:1px solid #63859e;background:#1b354a;color:white;border-radius:8px;font:inherit;width:min(100%,460px)}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;color:inherit;border:1px solid #52758f;background:#24465f;border-radius:5px;padding:7px 10px}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd36a;outline-offset:3px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:24px}article{background:#1b354a;border:1px solid #36566d;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;min-width:0}article header{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;font-size:15px}header span{color:#a6c4d8;white-space:nowrap}.picture{display:block;width:100%;height:260px;padding:8px;margin-top:10px;border:0;background:#122b3b;overflow:hidden}.picture img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}article p{font-size:11px;color:#adc6d8;margin:10px 0}article footer{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;font-size:11px}footer button{font-size:11px;padding:5px 8px}dialog{background:#132c40;color:white;border:1px solid #6cc9e5;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;width:min(1000px,95vw);max-height:95dvh;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#000b}dialog header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}dialog img{display:block;width:100%;height:min(65dvh,680px);object-fit:contain;margin:12px auto}dialog footer{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}#toast{color:#ffd36a;font-size:12px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:1100px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:780px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.picture{height:230px}}@media(max-width:450px){main{padding:18px 10px}.grid{gap:8px}article{padding:8px}article header{font-size:12px}.picture{height:170px}article footer{gap:6px}h1{font-size:21px}}
</style></head><body><main><h1>케이지 개선 이미지 · 33종</h1><p>32종을 승인한 미니 양호실의 도트·난간 스타일로 다듬고, 원본의 별도 구조물을 반영했습니다. C16은 승인본을 유지했습니다.<br>“C01 공터”, “C05 체육관”처럼 번호로 수정 요청하실 수 있습니다. 이미지를 누르면 크게 보고, 원본 구조물 참고 그림과 비교할 수 있습니다.<br>원본 참고 그림은 별도 OBJ를 OPM 위치와 첫 동작 셀로 합친 정적인 자료입니다. 개선본은 이를 게임의 현재 칸 모양에 맞춰 다시 그린 팬게임용 그림입니다.</p><nav><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="번호·이름 검색 (예: C01, 체육관)" aria-label="케이지 검색"><a href="index.html">게임으로 돌아가기</a><span id="count">33종</span><span id="toast" role="status"></span></nav><section class="grid" aria-label="케이지 목록">'''+''.join(cards)+'''</section></main>
<dialog id="viewer"><header><b id="heading"></b><button id="close" aria-label="닫기">닫기 ✕</button></header><img id="large" alt=""><footer><button id="prev">← 이전</button><button id="toggle">원본 + 구조물 보기</button><button id="next">다음 →</button></footer></dialog>
<script>
const cards=[...document.querySelectorAll('article')],pictures=cards.map(a=>a.querySelector('.picture')),viewer=document.querySelector('#viewer'),large=document.querySelector('#large');let current=0,original=false;
function draw(){const p=pictures[current];document.querySelector('#heading').textContent=p.dataset.title+(original?' · 원본 구조물 참고':' · 개선본');large.src=original?p.dataset.original:p.dataset.asset;large.alt=document.querySelector('#heading').textContent;document.querySelector('#toggle').textContent=original?'개선본 보기':'원본 + 구조물 보기';}
pictures.forEach((p,i)=>p.onclick=()=>{current=i;original=false;draw();viewer.showModal();});document.querySelector('#close').onclick=()=>viewer.close();document.querySelector('#toggle').onclick=()=>{original=!original;draw();};document.querySelector('#prev').onclick=()=>{current=(current+pictures.length-1)%pictures.length;draw();};document.querySelector('#next').onclick=()=>{current=(current+1)%pictures.length;draw();};document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(!viewer.open)return;if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')document.querySelector('#prev').click();if(e.key==='ArrowRight')document.querySelector('#next').click();});
cards.forEach(a=>{let showing=false;a.querySelector('.compare').onclick=()=>{showing=!showing;const p=a.querySelector('.picture');p.querySelector('img').src=showing?p.dataset.original:p.dataset.asset;a.querySelector('.compare').textContent=showing?'개선본 보기':'원본 + 구조물 보기';};a.querySelector('.copy').onclick=async e=>{const code=e.currentTarget.dataset.code;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);document.querySelector('#toast').textContent=code+' 번호 복사됨';}catch{document.querySelector('#toast').textContent='수정 요청 번호: '+a.id;}};});
document.querySelector('#search').oninput=e=>{const v=e.target.value.toLowerCase().trim();let n=0;cards.forEach(a=>{a.hidden=!a.dataset.search.toLowerCase().includes(v);if(!a.hidden)n++;});document.querySelector('#count').textContent=n+'종';};
</script></body></html>'''
(REPO/'web/cage-gallery.html').write_text(page,encoding='utf-8')
print('Cage gallery generated: 33 numbered originals/improvements.')
